{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-haiku-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:44:16.545Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"0af67b6bd502296b39fe786e76a090a2a3e124373573d5241edafc7ea5b4bcc8","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@ruth.calloway Based on Moss's Strategic digests (the most recent ones that name owners), with the caveat that I can't see the CRM:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. Changed hands on 2026-05-04, moving from Nadia Fennimore. Moss's 5/3 digest set the date and the 5/4 digest confirms it. The June QBR plan and 8/3 digest also name it as Gideon's biggest account.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. Named as his fleet account in the 12/1/2025 digest and the June QBR plan. The 5/4/2026 digest says he also assumed management that day.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The 9/30/2026 digest calls it Gideon's medical account. It was Nadia's in the 3/10/2025 digest, so the change happened between March 2025 and the later digests, but no digest gives an exact date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: no owner named in any digest I read. I can't confirm it from these sources.\n\nFor the slide, I'd check the CRM or ask Gideon to confirm the Orlavine and Quillfeather owners before it goes to the board."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
